# Health probes (EP-56, EP-57). Anonymous, no route prefix, not rate limited. Read-only.
# OpenAPI: api-tests/openapi/v1.json. Catalog: docs/product/04-architecture/endpoint-catalog.md section 9.
#   npx --yes httpyac@6.16.7 send health/health.http --all -e local   (from api-tests/http)

### GET Health - Live (EP-56)
# @expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### GET Health - Live ignores an invalid bearer token (EP-56)
# Probes must never return 401, even with a bad token (a random GUID is not a JWT).
# @expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Authorization: Bearer {{$guid}}

### GET Health - Ready (EP-57)
# 200 Healthy, 200 Degraded (Valkey down). 503 means PostgreSQL is down.
# @expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### GET Health - Ready ignores an invalid bearer token (EP-57)
# @expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{$guid}}
